# The bullpen's roster: every role the coordinator may open, one per
# line. Nothing opens by default; the coordinator opens a role when
# GitHub hands it work and closes it when the work lands.
#
# Every lane runs on Sonnet at low effort ("very lean", 2026-10-28).
#
#   role  class  kind  color  [claude flags...]
#
# class: impl     an implementer (at most 3 live, BULLPEN_IMPL_CAP)
#        review   a reviewer or checker (at most 2 live,
#                 BULLPEN_REVIEW_CAP)
#        liaison  opened only when the owner works in the terminal and
#                 several agents have questions for them
# kind:  site  a worktree of the site repository at
#              ~/Code/nff/lanes/<role>, on branch lane/<role> cut from
#              origin/staging, npm ci'd
#        desk  a plain folder at ~/Code/nff/lanes/<role> (no git)
#        path=<folder>  an existing folder (a clone or worktree made by
#              hand, as for the dashboard and this repository)
# color: one of /color's names (red orange yellow green cyan blue purple
#        pink), for the pane's title and its prompt bar alike.
# flags: passed to claude as is.
# A role starts from its brief (roles/<role>.md), or, when its folder
# has .ignored/resume.md, from that.
#
# One-off implementer roles (one per piece of work) are added here when
# the coordinator hires them and removed when their work lands. Write
# each brief from scratch for the new work.

liaison         liaison  desk   cyan    --model claude-sonnet-5-5 --effort low
project-manager liaison  desk   orange  --model claude-sonnet-5-5 --effort low

# Reviewers.
qa              review   path=~/Code/nff/lanes/qa  pink  --model claude-sonnet-5-5 --effort low
security        review   site   cyan    --model claude-sonnet-5-5 --effort low
communications  review   site   purple  --model claude-sonnet-5-5 --effort low

# The shared process repo, north-foster-farm/nff-agentic-workflow.
workflow        impl     path=~/Code/nff/lanes/workflow  purple  --model claude-sonnet-5-5 --effort low
